# Write Memory Skill

## Invocation
`@[.agents/skills/write-memory]` or `@[01-prompts/03-read-write/04-write-memory.md]`

## Core Mandates
1. Persist session decisions, learned patterns, and task status into `.ai-memory/`.
2. Update `.ai-memory/plans/readme.md` and `.ai-memory/what-to-read.md`.
3. Never consolidate detailed specifications into vague summaries.
4. Update `.ai-memory/strictly-avoid.md` with negative rules.
5. Record real numbers for completed tasks.
